OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F405A1788242208
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACall to extend Liverpool's vital
OL,4,Anight bus service
OL,5,
OL,6,FCraig Pennington, of Future Yard
OL,7,Fcommunity music venue in Birkenhead,
OL,8,Fsaid the late night transport had
OL,9,F"removed barriers" for staff - with
OL,10,Fstories of some sleeping in dressing
OL,11,Frooms when they could not get home
OL,12,Fpreviously - and customers who had been
OL,13,Fforced to leave early or not go at all.
OL,15,FHe's among those calling for the
OL,16,Fservice to be extended to support more
OL,17,Fvenues, workers and communities across
OL,18,Fthe city region.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
